WEBVTT

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:08.480
Kaito!

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:16.280
Kaito!

00:00:22.230 --> 00:00:24.460
He... abandoned the Armlet.

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:29.360
Why? Why won't he join my side?

00:00:29.360 --> 00:00:30.410
Master Rook.

00:00:30.410 --> 00:00:32.520
No. No!

00:00:33.380 --> 00:00:35.940
NO!

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:39.810
Kaito is mine! Kaito is MINE!

00:00:40.330 --> 00:00:41.810
Calm yourself, Master Rook.

00:00:41.840 --> 00:00:44.760
No! No! Kaito!

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:47.060
Kaito belongs to me!

00:00:48.320 --> 00:00:51.510
KAITO IS MINE!

00:00:54.810 --> 00:00:56.540
Unbelievable.

00:00:57.010 --> 00:01:00.450
Is that the same Master
Rook we've revered?

00:01:02.720 --> 00:01:05.430
He's like a brat that
got his toy taken away.

00:01:06.010 --> 00:01:07.850
I couldn't bear to watch.

00:01:07.850 --> 00:01:10.790
It's a pity, but I can't
follow him any longer...

00:01:10.790 --> 00:01:12.130
Me neither.

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:13.420
Diceman!

00:01:13.850 --> 00:01:14.810
Eh?

00:01:14.810 --> 00:01:16.370
What will you do?

00:01:16.370 --> 00:01:20.430
Er, I, uh, well...

00:01:20.920 --> 00:01:22.560
Gammon, what about you?

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:23.180
Huh?

00:01:24.710 --> 00:01:26.440
Gammon?

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:32.410
When they saw the top-secret info your

00:01:32.410 --> 00:01:34.650
friends sent and that video of Master Rook,

00:01:34.650 --> 00:01:38.020
the big wigs around the world
went into a huge panic.

00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:41.800
POG is done for, isn't it?

00:01:42.540 --> 00:01:44.280
What are you going to do now?

00:01:45.330 --> 00:01:46.460
Can't say.

00:01:49.130 --> 00:01:50.960
I wouldn't mind helping you out.

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:04.660
Rook is gonna risk everything he's got

00:02:04.660 --> 00:02:06.580
when he makes his move.

00:02:07.830 --> 00:02:10.230
Can you win, Kaito?

00:02:19.100 --> 00:02:20.280
Kaito...

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:41.840
Kimi no nounai e to shinnyuu
Gonna infiltrate your brain

00:02:41.840 --> 00:02:44.640
Nemutteru suki ni baby, open the gate
While you're sleeping, baby, open the gate

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:46.430
Fukuzatsusugi security
Too-complicated security

00:02:46.430 --> 00:02:49.180
Kakusareru to abakitakunaru
When something's hidden, it makes me want to expose it

00:02:49.180 --> 00:02:53.690
Barabara ni chirabatte iru password o hiroiatsume
I'll gather up those loose, scattered passwords

00:02:53.690 --> 00:02:58.400
Kakushin ni sematte yuku, sono shoutai o misete
And approach the core, so show me that true form

00:02:58.400 --> 00:03:00.610
Kantan ni clear dekinai
I can't clear it easily

00:03:00.610 --> 00:03:03.280
Saki nante motto yomenai
Can read what lies ahead even less

00:03:03.280 --> 00:03:05.280
Kaidoku fukanou smile
A smile that can't be deciphered

00:03:05.280 --> 00:03:07.580
Kiken na puzzle
A dangerous puzzle

00:03:07.580 --> 00:03:09.540
Lock sareteta door aru nara
If there's a door that's been locked

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:12.330
Zutto tataite miru beki, kaza-ana hiraku wa
You must keep striking it, a crack will open

00:03:12.330 --> 00:03:16.880
Eien ni hodokenai nazo nanka wa nai
No mystery remains unsolved forever

00:03:16.880 --> 00:03:19.130
Makiokosu, it's a supernova!
It's forming, it's a supernova!

00:03:19.130 --> 00:03:23.800
Tobikiri shigekiteki na hirameki o agemashou
I will give you thoroughly stimulating insight

00:03:23.800 --> 00:03:26.060
Misskey-misskey la-tu-ma

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:28.390
Yume no naka, it's a supernova!
In the middle of a dream, it's a supernova!

00:03:28.390 --> 00:03:31.020
Watashi wa, sou, brain diver
I am, yes, a brain diver

00:03:31.020 --> 00:03:36.900
Kimi ga sagashimotometeru kotae ni nareru made
Until I become familiar with the answer you seek

00:03:39.570 --> 00:03:42.570
Brain diver

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:47.330
Brain diver

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:55.960
The Eternal Being

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:01.420
The man you saw in the future-

00:04:01.790 --> 00:04:06.680
Yeah... It changed from me... to Rook.

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:14.720
Is that future going to be realized?

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:17.190
And by Rook's hands...?

00:04:18.530 --> 00:04:20.750
Nope, nope! That won't happen.

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:22.140
If the conditions change,

00:04:22.140 --> 00:04:23.510
doesn't the future change too?

00:04:23.510 --> 00:04:25.160
It'll be A-Okay!

00:04:26.090 --> 00:04:28.200
Don't make it sound so simple!

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:31.630
Jeez, he can be a pain, huh?

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:34.370
Here he is making his best friend worry!

00:04:34.900 --> 00:04:38.630
But even now, he still likes you.

00:04:41.220 --> 00:04:44.720
Kaito, you told me everything
without keeping any secrets.

00:04:44.720 --> 00:04:46.460
Wise move!

00:04:46.460 --> 00:04:47.760
'Scuse me?

00:04:47.760 --> 00:04:49.260
Now keep it up and

00:04:49.260 --> 00:04:51.470
don't keep any more secrets from me.

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:55.020
And don't leave me behind.

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:57.230
Got it? You gotta promise!

00:04:58.930 --> 00:05:01.310
Yeah, I promise.

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:05.240
Who's calling at this hour?

00:05:05.690 --> 00:05:06.760
Hello?

00:05:09.140 --> 00:05:11.480
Who is it? What do you want?

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.310
Hey, Kaito.

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:14.810
It's me.

00:05:15.760 --> 00:05:16.750
Rook!

00:05:48.060 --> 00:05:49.100
Kaito...

00:05:50.740 --> 00:05:52.410
Kaito!

00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:55.750
Kaito!

00:06:01.350 --> 00:06:03.750
What is up... with that?

00:06:08.770 --> 00:06:10.310
Thank goodness!

00:06:10.690 --> 00:06:13.900
I was afraid
you wouldn't come.

00:06:14.610 --> 00:06:17.100
Rook, what do you want from me?

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.550
What are you scheming?

00:06:20.660 --> 00:06:24.400
Sheesh! It's just like I said
on the phone last night.

00:06:25.050 --> 00:06:26.590
Thank you, Kaito.

00:06:26.590 --> 00:06:28.850
You made my dream come true.

00:06:30.360 --> 00:06:33.180
So, Kaito, have you eaten yet?

00:06:33.180 --> 00:06:36.070
Uh, no, not yet...

00:06:36.070 --> 00:06:38.860
Same here. I'm starving!

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:40.470
H-hey, hold your horses, Rook!

00:06:40.470 --> 00:06:41.420
Hey!

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:45.920
Here ya go!

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:56.970
Rook!

00:06:57.820 --> 00:06:58.800
Eat up.

00:07:08.720 --> 00:07:09.920
I'll help myself.

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:14.030
H-hot!

00:07:14.030 --> 00:07:16.900
Be careful or you'll burn your mouth.

00:07:24.820 --> 00:07:25.940
Kaito?

00:07:26.570 --> 00:07:28.530
There was something inside of it.

00:07:28.530 --> 00:07:30.610
Oh, the octy.

00:07:30.610 --> 00:07:32.880
O-octy? Octopus?

00:07:33.480 --> 00:07:35.750
This your first time eating one?

00:07:35.750 --> 00:07:38.150
Yeah, but it's good.

00:07:38.150 --> 00:07:40.600
Really? Glad to hear it.

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:48.470
The GPS is functioning correctly.

00:07:48.470 --> 00:07:51.800
Kaito is in front of the shopping
district's takoyaki stall.

00:07:51.800 --> 00:07:53.110
He just ate his third one.

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:56.280
Didn't he want another puzzle battle?

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:59.090
Why did Rook ask to see Kaito?

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:01.870
It definitely wasn't for the takoyaki.

00:08:02.380 --> 00:08:05.500
I was surprised when Nonoha filled me in.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:06.880
I never thought...

00:08:07.200 --> 00:08:09.710
Eh?! You're gonna see Rook by yourself?

00:08:10.230 --> 00:08:12.490
He'd like to go back to the old times...

00:08:12.490 --> 00:08:14.660
just for one day.

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:15.850
Or so he said.

00:08:15.850 --> 00:08:17.480
Why'd you give the okay?!

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:20.440
It's too dangerous.
He's clearly up to something!

00:08:20.440 --> 00:08:22.060
I want to know.

00:08:22.470 --> 00:08:24.680
To change the future,

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:27.110
I gotta find out what Rook's thinking.

00:08:29.370 --> 00:08:30.980
I openly told you everything,

00:08:30.980 --> 00:08:32.190
so let me go.

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:36.690
Then get Rook to change his mind!

00:08:36.690 --> 00:08:38.660
Get him to make up with you.

00:08:39.300 --> 00:08:40.160
Nonoha?

00:08:40.480 --> 00:08:43.190
If you... if you tell him
as his best friend...

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:45.000
I'm sure you'll get through to him!

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:49.030
I'll give it a try.

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:56.390
Weekly Puzzle Boy
Number Crosswords MAX

00:08:53.240 --> 00:08:56.390
Wow, amazing! There's
so many puzzle magazines.

00:08:56.840 --> 00:08:57.670
Yeah.

00:08:57.670 --> 00:09:00.390
I didn't know since I hardly ever go out.

00:09:04.970 --> 00:09:07.310
It's not bad or anything, but I...!

00:09:10.310 --> 00:09:11.820
Hey!

00:09:13.760 --> 00:09:15.630
That will be 480 yen.

00:09:15.630 --> 00:09:17.870
Rook, you punk!

00:09:17.870 --> 00:09:20.330
Sorry! I got caught up in it.

00:09:22.530 --> 00:09:26.620
I might be able to make a fun puzzle
using tracks and points.

00:09:27.070 --> 00:09:28.630
What do you think, Kaito?

00:09:29.440 --> 00:09:31.420
Oh, sounds good.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:33.110
Give me a crack at it when it's done.

00:09:35.470 --> 00:09:37.120
Pawn to G5.

00:09:37.710 --> 00:09:39.470
Knight to D4.

00:09:39.890 --> 00:09:42.600
Queen to E1. Check!

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:43.470
Aw, crap!

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:46.420
Retreat King to G2.

00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:48.980
Then I'll...

00:10:06.390 --> 00:10:07.750
Thank you for waiting.

00:10:08.340 --> 00:10:10.580
How many packets of
sugar and milk would you like?

00:10:10.990 --> 00:10:13.340
I'll take 48 packets of sugar.

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:15.090
O-okay!

00:10:23.950 --> 00:10:26.430
You really do love puzzles, don't you?

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:29.770
Kaito, you used to love them, too.

00:10:29.770 --> 00:10:31.440
Puzzles were your only friends.

00:10:34.730 --> 00:10:38.500
But Kaito, you used puzzles
as your boat to set sail,

00:10:38.500 --> 00:10:42.070
made some pals and befriended the world.

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:46.120
There! It's all done.

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:48.920
That's a good puzzle.

00:10:51.010 --> 00:10:53.250
This is the town you live in.

00:10:53.930 --> 00:10:56.760
It's clean, bright and cheerful.

00:10:57.020 --> 00:10:58.510
You have friends here...

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:00.760
...and everyone is smiling.

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:05.330
That isn't limited to
me. If you wanted, you-

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:10.410
Why now of all times?

00:11:11.710 --> 00:11:12.920
Sender: Nonoha Itou
To: Kaito
No Subject
Are you okay?

00:11:13.280 --> 00:11:15.480
She's so pesky, sheesh!

00:11:16.060 --> 00:11:20.450
"I'm eating lunch. Set A, no pickles,"
and send.

00:11:24.090 --> 00:11:26.860
Nonoha Itou. It was her, wasn't it?

00:11:28.120 --> 00:11:30.960
She's worried about you, Kaito.

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:35.410
You really have it good, Kaito.

00:11:43.470 --> 00:11:45.010
That smile of Rook's...

00:11:46.490 --> 00:11:48.140
...is the same as back then!

00:11:49.920 --> 00:11:50.890
So why...

00:11:51.700 --> 00:11:53.670
Why will he bring ruin?

00:11:54.470 --> 00:11:55.510
Rook...

00:12:09.370 --> 00:12:11.220
I believed in him.

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:16.500
I had believed Master Rook
would run POG someday.

00:12:16.500 --> 00:12:18.600
But the current director is

00:12:18.600 --> 00:12:20.670
not the same director as before.

00:12:21.080 --> 00:12:22.320
I don't know...

00:12:23.070 --> 00:12:27.350
I can't see where Master Rook is headed.

00:12:27.840 --> 00:12:32.870
The director still cares for his former
best friend, Kaito Daimon.

00:12:33.370 --> 00:12:35.760
He is reaching out to his heart.

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:43.020
On that day, you became "eternal" to me.

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:46.870
It was the day I was told you had died.

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:51.370
Of course I was happy when
I heard that you were alive.

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:56.130
But at the same time,
I planned out a glorious puzzle.

00:12:56.980 --> 00:12:59.140
It'd turn you into an "eternal being,"

00:12:59.140 --> 00:13:01.500
so I'll never lose you again.

00:13:02.100 --> 00:13:03.110
A puzzle?

00:13:03.790 --> 00:13:06.890
So you were the one
who made all these puzzles?

00:13:07.390 --> 00:13:10.330
Both of us are inside a puzzle,

00:13:10.330 --> 00:13:13.360
but we'll solve the puzzle soon.

00:13:13.360 --> 00:13:15.890
A screwed up puzzle with no answer.

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:17.510
It isn't messed up.

00:13:18.180 --> 00:13:19.740
I'm the one who made it,

00:13:19.740 --> 00:13:24.400
so my desired future
is definitely waiting at the exit.

00:13:25.500 --> 00:13:27.090
Did you find what you were looking for?

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:28.920
Yeah.

00:13:33.530 --> 00:13:34.540
That's-!

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:36.500
That prairie is...

00:13:36.500 --> 00:13:38.940
I had a hard time getting used to

00:13:38.940 --> 00:13:40.970
Root Gakuen when I first went there.

00:13:40.970 --> 00:13:43.800
I came here to look at
this picture all the time.

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:47.140
Wasn't it fun back then?

00:13:48.460 --> 00:13:50.640
It was just Jin, you and me.

00:13:51.980 --> 00:13:55.770
I'm making a new wooden
cross puzzle right now.

00:13:56.220 --> 00:13:58.350
When it's finished, I'll give it to you.

00:13:58.350 --> 00:13:59.480
Huh? Really?

00:13:59.880 --> 00:14:03.950
And always keep that puzzle on you, okay?

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:07.740
And every time you see it, remember me.

00:14:08.090 --> 00:14:10.490
Okay! Thank you, Rook!

00:14:11.130 --> 00:14:14.020
We'll always be together. It's a promise.

00:14:14.020 --> 00:14:15.430
Yeah!

00:14:18.180 --> 00:14:19.500
Let's go back to like then.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:22.390
Rook, let's go back.

00:14:23.670 --> 00:14:25.470
No, I'll take us back.

00:14:25.470 --> 00:14:28.420
That is the puzzle I am meant to solve.

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:32.200
Kaito, your life is a piece of my puzzle.

00:14:33.950 --> 00:14:36.140
There's no escape.

00:14:46.730 --> 00:14:47.870
Thank you.

00:14:48.680 --> 00:14:51.780
I truly had a good time today.

00:14:52.310 --> 00:14:56.730
Kaito, I want you to grant one last wish.

00:14:58.150 --> 00:14:59.490
What did you say?

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:01.370
Are you certain?

00:15:01.920 --> 00:15:03.500
Yes. What of it?

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:05.900
Even without the Armlet of Orpheus,

00:15:05.900 --> 00:15:07.580
he was able to activate

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:13.680
I can't believe he has
developed like that...

00:15:10.450 --> 00:15:14.350
his brain to its fullest potential?

00:15:14.450 --> 00:15:16.430
What on Earth happened to Kaito?

00:15:16.980 --> 00:15:19.320
What is going on?

00:15:20.350 --> 00:15:21.490
Where is the director?

00:15:21.490 --> 00:15:24.410
Sir, he went out this morning by himself.

00:15:26.790 --> 00:15:30.560
What is it? What's this final wish?

00:15:31.470 --> 00:15:33.510
I want you to risk your life...

00:15:34.590 --> 00:15:35.870
fighting me.

00:15:36.280 --> 00:15:38.370
What?! Don't be stupid!

00:15:38.990 --> 00:15:42.880
Why do we have to risk our lives
fighting each other?!

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:46.500
It's so we can become "eternal".

00:15:48.420 --> 00:15:50.820
If I win and you die,

00:15:50.820 --> 00:15:53.510
you will become
"eternal" within me.

00:15:53.520 --> 00:15:57.500
If I die, I will become
"eternal" within you.

00:15:58.420 --> 00:16:02.900
Either way, I will obtain the
"eternal us" I so desire.

00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:06.360
That is the answer to the puzzle I made.

00:16:06.950 --> 00:16:10.110
Rook, what's gotten into you?

00:16:10.550 --> 00:16:12.490
You can't refuse,

00:16:13.390 --> 00:16:14.620
because...

00:16:14.940 --> 00:16:15.870
What's that?

00:16:17.470 --> 00:16:18.790
The Book of God.

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:24.450
You're lying! That's BS!

00:16:24.450 --> 00:16:25.540
You can't obtain the Book of God

00:16:25.540 --> 00:16:26.970
without solving the Puzzle of-

00:16:26.970 --> 00:16:29.500
The old philosopher Pythagoras sealed

00:16:29.500 --> 00:16:32.370
the Book of God in the Puzzle of God.

00:16:33.010 --> 00:16:36.180
It is impossible to solve unless
two Phi-Brains

00:16:36.740 --> 00:16:38.010
fight to the death.

00:16:38.410 --> 00:16:39.390
You don't mean...

00:16:39.390 --> 00:16:40.480
Right.

00:16:40.480 --> 00:16:43.040
During the battle between
Jin and Count Pythagoras,

00:16:43.040 --> 00:16:46.360
the Puzzle of God was released

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:48.940
and the Book of God was
bequeathed unto mankind.

00:16:49.980 --> 00:16:53.060
What type of power does
the Book of God hold?

00:16:53.060 --> 00:16:55.320
Count Pythagoras looked inside of it.

00:16:55.790 --> 00:17:00.400
He became possessed by
its mystic and diabolic luster.

00:17:00.420 --> 00:17:01.620
He focused on deciphering it to

00:17:01.620 --> 00:17:03.340
the point
that he forgot to eat and sleep.

00:17:04.040 --> 00:17:06.960
He ultimately died, unable to solve the

00:17:06.960 --> 00:17:09.390
puzzle and obtain ultimate power.

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:13.640
I don't care about the
Book of God's contents.

00:17:14.340 --> 00:17:16.800
I don't need anything other than us being

00:17:16.800 --> 00:17:18.010
together forever.

00:17:18.970 --> 00:17:21.390
I don't need the Book of God, a future,

00:17:21.390 --> 00:17:23.430
or even my memories of us with Jin...

00:17:23.880 --> 00:17:26.270
No, I don't even need Jin.

00:17:32.850 --> 00:17:36.570
Everyone is trying to steal you from me.

00:17:37.100 --> 00:17:40.030
I won't forgive them!

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:42.590
If I expose the Book of God to the world,

00:17:42.590 --> 00:17:44.590
people will come to steal it!

00:17:44.590 --> 00:17:47.560
Those in power who seek ultimate power

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:49.760
will go mad and raise their guns.

00:17:49.760 --> 00:17:53.040
After all of the destruction and carnage,

00:17:53.040 --> 00:17:54.700
the world will come to an end!

00:17:55.680 --> 00:17:59.210
I will slaughter everyone
if you refuse to fight.

00:17:59.210 --> 00:18:02.780
I'll slaughter towns, Jin, your friends

00:18:02.780 --> 00:18:04.310
and everyone in the world!

00:18:06.700 --> 00:18:08.440
So that's what that meant.

00:18:08.840 --> 00:18:10.390
Fight, Kaito!

00:18:10.390 --> 00:18:12.470
Fight with the future
on the line!

00:18:12.470 --> 00:18:13.500
Fight me!

00:18:13.980 --> 00:18:15.280
I won't let you.

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:17.840
I will protect the world.

00:18:18.650 --> 00:18:20.760
I won't let you go to that world.

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:23.080
I will remake...

00:18:23.570 --> 00:18:25.010
your puzzle...

00:18:25.010 --> 00:18:26.580
by force!

00:18:49.920 --> 00:18:50.890
Kaito!

00:18:51.780 --> 00:18:53.690
Sorry for calling you out.

00:18:54.550 --> 00:18:56.030
How did it go?

00:18:56.030 --> 00:18:58.400
Did Rook say he would stop fighting you?

00:19:00.580 --> 00:19:03.360
He did, didn't he? After all,
you're his best friend.

00:19:03.360 --> 00:19:04.660
You got through to him, right?

00:19:05.080 --> 00:19:07.430
Did you bring some Nonoha Sweets?

00:19:08.110 --> 00:19:09.210
Y-yeah...

00:19:19.270 --> 00:19:21.410
It's edible if I force it down.

00:19:21.410 --> 00:19:22.920
Actually, it's good!

00:19:22.920 --> 00:19:24.840
Jeez, these were actually good?

00:19:27.330 --> 00:19:28.300
Thank you, Nonoha.

00:19:29.030 --> 00:19:30.260
Take care.

00:19:31.750 --> 00:19:32.750
Kaito?

00:19:41.170 --> 00:19:43.310
Wait, Kaito! Don't leave me!

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:46.310
You promised you wouldn't
leave me behind!

00:19:46.310 --> 00:19:47.900
Take me with you!

00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:53.330
Take me with you, you puzzle-loving liar!

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:58.300
Jin, I'm here for you.

00:19:58.940 --> 00:20:01.700
Let's watch those two to the end. Kaito-

00:20:02.320 --> 00:20:03.350
What are you going?!

00:20:04.160 --> 00:20:06.090
You bastards! How did you get in...!

00:20:06.090 --> 00:20:06.720
Like this!

00:20:09.160 --> 00:20:10.380
Gammon?!

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:12.870
Let's go, Principal!

00:20:15.350 --> 00:20:16.650
Kaito!

00:20:29.470 --> 00:20:31.370
This is POG's...!

00:20:36.090 --> 00:20:37.270
You're-!

00:20:37.270 --> 00:20:39.170
Master Rook and Kaito Daimon

00:20:39.170 --> 00:20:41.950
are trying to crack the Puzzle of God.

00:20:41.950 --> 00:20:42.760
They're what?!

00:20:43.330 --> 00:20:45.260
We must stop them at all cost.

00:20:45.850 --> 00:20:47.250
I need your help.

00:20:47.790 --> 00:20:49.260
I'm going, too.

00:20:49.710 --> 00:20:51.020
That moron!

00:20:51.480 --> 00:20:53.020
I won't let him off easy!

00:20:54.810 --> 00:20:55.970
If Kaito Daimon,

00:20:55.970 --> 00:20:59.720
who has developed
beyond our comprehension,

00:20:59.720 --> 00:21:01.540
and the Phi-Brain, Master Rook,

00:21:01.540 --> 00:21:02.900
were to fight with all their might...

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:05.170
Its outcome would be even more tragic

00:21:05.170 --> 00:21:06.570
than the one from the fight

00:21:06.570 --> 00:21:08.890
between
Count Pythagoras and Jin.

00:21:08.890 --> 00:21:10.170
Isn't that right?

00:21:10.720 --> 00:21:11.730
That's horrible!

00:21:11.730 --> 00:21:13.290
So where did Kaito go?

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:15.820
The island where Phi-Brains have

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:17.790
challenged the Puzzle
of God since antiquity:

00:21:18.640 --> 00:21:20.050
Orpheus Island.

00:21:21.900 --> 00:21:24.220
If you were a god, you could do it.

00:21:24.830 --> 00:21:27.480
But I want you to tell me.

00:21:28.320 --> 00:21:30.630
How could a single human

00:21:30.630 --> 00:21:34.470
accompany him with a mere lyre?

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:38.170
Apollo's shrine was not in the land

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:39.980
were their hearts intersected.

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:42.440
He exists in song.

00:21:42.740 --> 00:21:44.750
That's nothing to the gods.

00:21:45.560 --> 00:21:48.950
But where do we exist?

00:21:49.780 --> 00:21:53.200
And when will the gods...?

00:22:37.240 --> 00:22:41.540
Tsukue no ue de umareta sekai
A world born on top of a desk

00:22:41.540 --> 00:22:47.340
Ichiban saki ni kimi ni misetakatta
I wanted to show it to you first of all

00:22:47.770 --> 00:22:52.090
Karappo no heya sotto nukedashite
I sneaked silently out of that empty room

00:22:52.090 --> 00:22:57.210
Hashirihajimeteta
And started running

00:22:58.290 --> 00:23:02.610
Iki hazumasete oka o noboru to
Breathing heavily, I climbed the hill

00:23:02.610 --> 00:23:08.220
Kimi ga saki ni tsuite matte ita ne
And you were already there, waiting

00:23:08.900 --> 00:23:13.160
Takusan no hajimete kimi to mitsuketa
There were so many treasures that I first

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:17.910
Takaramono datta
Discovered with you

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:24.020
Kanashisa de afureta toki wa
That time when I was overcome with sadness

00:23:24.020 --> 00:23:26.600
Nanimo iwazu ni tada
You said nothing

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:29.250
Soba ni ite kureta ne
Just stayed there by my side, didn't you?

00:23:29.250 --> 00:23:33.910
Imademo wasurenai yo
Even now, I haven't forgotten

00:23:33.910 --> 00:23:39.180
Mata aou ne, yakusoku o shiyou
Let's meet again, let's make it a promise

00:23:39.180 --> 00:23:44.400
Kei wa shinai, ano hi no sayonara
It won't fade, the "goodbye" of that day

00:23:44.400 --> 00:23:50.050
Boku no subete, kimi ga kureta michi
Everything I have, the path you gave me

00:23:50.050 --> 00:23:58.960
Zutto kokoro no naka hikaru yo
Will always shine within my heart

00:24:03.500 --> 00:24:07.480
We can no longer feel
loneliness or sadness.

00:24:07.480 --> 00:24:10.470
That's because this puzzle
is going to make us eternal.

00:24:10.470 --> 00:24:12.220
Your "eternity" ain't going to happen.

00:24:12.220 --> 00:24:14.180
I swear I'm going to bring you back!

00:24:14.480 --> 00:24:17.190
I'll do it by solving
that puzzle you made!

00:24:18.340 --> 00:24:21.210
Kaito, you can solve any
and every puzzle, can't you?

00:24:21.210 --> 00:24:23.110
That's why I'm...

00:24:23.110 --> 00:24:26.120
Next up, "Let's Begin Puzzle Time!"

00:24:23.420 --> 00:24:27.500
Let's Begin Puzzle Time!

00:24:26.120 --> 00:24:29.150
Let's go, Rook!
